Step 2: F returns. S1: {F, W, C}, S2: {G} (safe)
Step 3: F takes W. S1: {C} (safe), S2: {F, G, W} (F is with W and G)
Step 4: F returns with G. S1: {F, G, C}, S2: {W} (safe)
Step 5: F takes C. S1: {G} (safe), S2: {F, W, C} (F is with W and C)
Step 6: F returns. S1: {F, G}, S2: {W, C} (safe)
Step 7: F takes G. S1: {}, S2: {F, W, G, C}

The solution is consistent with the rules.","answer":"7","confidence":5.0}

